@description Rea-Sixty
@author Frank Acklin
@version 0.8.1
@changelog
  - Codename: Armhangeddon
  - UC1: arming a track in a large project no longer holds REAPER up. On every arm REAPER reports the solo state of all tracks, and the UC1 was redrawn for each report (about one second per arm at 738 tracks); it now redraws once per batch (#11). Thanks to Tiago Rodrigues for the report and the testing
  - TotalMix on the UF8: UF8 V-Pot speed now applies to the V-Pots there too, not only the Fine factor
  - TotalMix side-car: the right half of a linked stereo pair no longer shows as a channel of its own; after unlinking, the right half shows its current level again
  - Known issue: Two UF8s has not been run on two units yet; with Second UF8 off one UF8 works as before
  - Known issue: if the MIDI CC layer shows Device busy next to its Input, switch the device off as an input in REAPER's MIDI preferences
  - Known issue: Windows 11 with Smart App Control on refuses to load the unsigned extension ("Bad Image"). Turning Smart App Control off lets it load.
